ps://catiregames.itch.io/snuggle-nightmare-tung-tung-sahur-horror-story/purchase\">Buy Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span itemprop=\"price\" class=\"dollars\">2.99€ EUR</span> <span class=\"sub\">or more</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p></p>\r\n<h2><u><em><strong>Welcome to Brain World Rots Theme Park!</strong></em></u></h2>\r\n<p>Brain World Rots is an indoor theme park equipped with state-of-the-art facilities and intelligent animatronics such as Tung Tung Sahur, the first advanced animatronic developed by Sing and Song Co.\r\n</p>\r\n<h2><u><em><strong>Snuggle Nightmare</strong></em></u></h2>\r\n<p>Following the mysterious closure of Brain World Rots, years later Sing and Song Co. plans the grand reopening of the famous theme park. Following a lead from an anonymous source, independent journalist Max Brush infiltrates the abandoned facilities to investigate the disappearances and hidden secrets behind the park’s closure.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>As you progress, you will discover hidden areas, forgotten documents, and clues about what truly happened inside Brain World Rots. But once inside, escaping will not be so easy.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>The park hides far more than it seems.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><span></span>\r\n</p>\r\n<h2><u><em><strong>Animatronics</strong></em></u></h2>\r\n<p>Our founder, Mike Anthony, had one clear goal: to create an animatronic capable of playing and interacting with children as if it were human. To achieve this, Sing and Song Co. developed models equipped with advanced artificial intelligence, realistic behaviors, and unique capabilities, designed to deliver an unforgettable family experience inside Brain World Rots.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Now, those animatronics are still active.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><span></span>\r\n</p>\r\n<h2><u><em><strong>Main Features</strong></em></u></h2>\r\n<ul><li>Hide and use your surroundings to avoid detection.\r\n</li><li>Solve envir